 "title": "What is BN(O) status?",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🇭🇰",
 "sentences": [
  "You can be a British national without being a British citizen.",
  "British National (Overseas) status is a class of nationality linked to former colony Hong Kong.",
  "People acquired this status through voluntary registration before the 1997 handover to China.",
  "Current residents cannot newly acquire this nationality.",
  "BN(O) holders are subject to UK immigration controls.",
  "Since 2021, the UK allows them to apply for a 5-year residence visa."
